    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "This is what most libraries do.\r\n\r\nIt is pointless to say that it's a bad usage without pointing to how to actually use it. The user is not expected to know that the `search` method must return a promise for instance.\r\n\r\nIt is our responsibility to make sure this link doesn't break. To prevent that, I think Algolia has a URL shortener. @Haroenv can give us more details here.",
